
<p>Chance Miller, 9to5Mac:</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>Here are the full details on the price increases:</p>

<ul>
<li>Apple TV (monthly): $14.99 (up from $12.99)</li>
<li>Apple TV (annual): $119 (up from $99)</li>
<li>Apple One Individual: $21.95 (up from $19.95)</li>
</ul>

<p>Prices for other Apple One plans are unchanged. When Apple
<a href="https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/17/apple-raises-prices-for-apple-music-and-apple-one-subscriptions/">increased</a> the price of Apple Music last month, it also raised
